        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Martin Luther</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1483 CE – 1546 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">10 November 1483 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eisleben">Eisleben</a>, County of Mansfeld, in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a>; eldest son of Hans Luder (later Luther), a leaseholder of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/copper">copper</a> mines and smelters, and Margarethe, née Lindemann</span></div>
